==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{confix|auto|cracy}}, from {{etyl|grc}} {{term|αὐτοκρατής|tr=autokrates||one who governs alone|lang=grc}}, from {{term|αὐτός|tr=autos||single, self, same, alone|lang=grc}} + {{term|κράτος|tr=kratos||power|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|autocrac|ies}}

# A form of [[government]] in which unlimited power is held by a single [[individual]].

